# armour/woman/lamellar_hang: (ARMOUR-W wave 2: the man's hang on her hips; her hangs ride the same hip anchor and widths as his, as padded_hang and leather_hang do) the Jade lamellar's mid-length skirt on the man (LADDER-ARMOUR, STYLE_P2 25.6 / 27.4): laced
# vertical plates split at the front, a solid band hem; it opens over the stride (wide) and trails in the run (flare). The
# people's ornaments are optional regions: `when scallops` scallops the hem (a pixel below every other hem cell), `when
# tassels` hangs a cord tassel (accent) at the split and the sides. The base grid keeps an empty row for them.
# Finish regions: R the band hem, N the lacing row, W a spot on the shadow side.
# Keys: the hang channel in D U R L. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. Source: LADDER-ARMOUR's expand.py (fill: lamellar).
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i1, P5) the lacing courses solid cords, the plate courses smooth planes (the blind
# panel: "the red-dotted lamellar is noise").
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i2) the skirt's lacing a step darker (accent 1 lit, 0 shadow): lacing, not stripes
# (LADDER-ARMOUR polish i3) quieter: one lacing cord across the chest; below the belt plain lacquer (the panel: "red-dotted
# lamellar is noise", "a stack of orange bars").
# (LADDER-ARMOUR alloys i1) a step-4 specular on the lit top of the first scales / lames / plates (top-left light):
# with no step 4 a coloured alloy read as clay; the glint and the dark core make any metal read as metal.
# (LADDER-ARMOUR alloys i2) the N lacing row dropped from the regions (the style lens: "Jade's lamellar is the busiest
# culture, 1 px gold banding on the torso and legs"): the gorget rim, the belt and the hem carry the trim; the lames
# read by their lit tops and dark undersides alone.
# (FORGE-LIMBS envelope r1) T5-T6 skirt flare (STYLE_P2 29.3): `armour.t5` views facing D/U, 1 px more past the hips on the lower half; flared copies of the replace views go before them. Generated by FORGE-LIMBS flare.py.
use person
body woman
role armour lamellar
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10

